  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Postharvest handling mapping, C&#xf4;te d&apos;Ivoire</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Investors like the World Bank (WB), European Union EU and the African Development Bank AfDB are increasingly active in the agri-food sector in C&#xf4;te d&apos;Ivoire (CdI) and post-harvest handling is a crucial part of the value chain. In collaboration with these institutions great impact can be made. The Netherlands has the expertise and technology to support CdI in developing the post-harvest handling industry.The focus of this study is therefore threefold:&#x2022;	Brief analysis of postharvest handling within the food system, with a focus on agro-(export-)logistics sector, the main challenges and the opportunities, in CdI;&#x2022;	Get an overview of recent implemented or ongoing projects in postharvest handling in CdI with a focus on the cocoa and horticulture sectors;&#x2022;	Appreciation of the potential of these projects and identification of possible Dutch involvement/contributions that could provide added value to the development of the post-harvest handling in CdI.</narrative>
  </description>
